# Line endings are pinned so this project is the same bytes on every machine.
#
# Git is often configured with core.autocrlf=true, which rewrites text files to
# CRLF on checkout. Everything OntoBoard generates is LF, so without this a
# Windows clone gets CRLF in the working tree - and then any byte comparison
# against regenerated content differs on that machine and nowhere else.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Not text: these are binary or effectively so.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.zip binary
